        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Afonwen, Flintshire, Wales, Britain\n- Roads: A55 road, North Wales Expressway, A541 Mold-Denbigh road, Chester to Bangor Trunk Road\n- Transport infrastructure: Caerwys railway station\n\nFacts:\n- The A55 road is a major road in Britain.\n- The A55 road is also known as the North Wales Expressway and the Chester to Bangor Trunk Road.\n- The North Wales Expressway is called \"Gwibffordd Gogledd Cymru\" in Welsh.\n- Afonwen is situated just under four miles from the A55 North Wales Expressway.\n- Afonwen is situated on the A541 Mold-Denbigh road.\n- Caerwys railway station was a railway station in Afonwen, Flintshire, Wales.",
